error[E0415]: global variable 'counter' must have the attribute #(static)
 --> test-code/errors/front/E0415-global-not-static.mu:3:1
  |
3 | counter := 0
  | ^^^^^^^ needs #(static)
  |
  = note: a global variable has static storage duration
  = help: write the attribute after the name, as in 'counter #(static) := 0'
